{
  "name": "facebook-poster",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "sticky-readme",
      "name": "Setup Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -260,
        -460
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 660,
        "height": 440,
        "content": "## facebook-poster\nWebhook-triggered, per-platform posting workflow for a Facebook Page. Credentials come from the request payload only \u2014 never stored in n8n (see websitePlan.md \u00a75).\n\n**After importing:** activate the workflow, then:\n\n```bash\ncurl -X POST http://localhost:5678/webhook/facebook-poster \\\n  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n  -d '{\n    \"post_id\": \"pst_test002\",\n    \"user_id\": \"usr_test\",\n    \"platform\": \"facebook\",\n    \"content\": \"Test post #smposting\",\n    \"media_type\": \"TEXT\",\n    \"media_urls\": [],\n    \"token\": {\n      \"page_id\": \"YOUR_FB_PAGE_ID\",\n      \"access_token\": \"YOUR_PAGE_ACCESS_TOKEN\"\n    },\n    \"callback_url\": \"https://webhook.site/your-id\"\n  }'\n```\n\n`media_type` accepts `TEXT | PHOTO | MULTI_PHOTO | VIDEO`. `TEXT` ignores `media_urls`. `PHOTO` needs 1 entry, `MULTI_PHOTO` needs 2+, `VIDEO` needs 1 (a direct hosted video URL \u2014 Graph API pulls it server-side, same as IG).\n\n**Not covered yet:** Facebook Reels (needs the chunked `video_reels` resumable upload API \u2014 a different mechanism from every other node here, since it uploads raw bytes instead of handing Graph API a URL) and link previews on TEXT posts. Both deferred as fast-follows."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "webhook-trigger",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -260,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "facebook-poster",
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "facebook-poster",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "parse-request",
      "name": "Parse Request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -40,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const body = $input.first().json.body || $input.first().json;\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    post_id: body.post_id,\n    user_id: body.user_id,\n    platform: body.platform || 'facebook',\n    content: body.content || '',\n    media_type: String(body.media_type || '').toUpperCase(),\n    media_urls: body.media_urls || [],\n    page_id: body.token && body.token.page_id,\n    access_token: body.token && body.token.access_token,\n    callback_url: body.callback_url || 'http://localhost:5000/api/webhooks/n8n-callback'\n  }\n}];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "route-media-type",
      "name": "Route by Media Type",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [
        180,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "rules",
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "outputKey": "TEXT",
              "renameOutput": true,
              "conditions": {
                "combinator": "and",
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "mt-text",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.media_type }}",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals",
                      "singleValue": true
                    },
                    "rightValue": "TEXT"
                  }
                ],
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "loose"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "outputKey": "PHOTO",
              "renameOutput": true,
              "conditions": {
                "combinator": "and",
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "mt-photo",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.media_type }}",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals",
                      "singleValue": true
                    },
                    "rightValue": "PHOTO"
                  }
                ],
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "loose"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "outputKey": "MULTI_PHOTO",
              "renameOutput": true,
              "conditions": {
                "combinator": "and",
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "mt-multiphoto",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.media_type }}",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals",
                      "singleValue": true
                    },
                    "rightValue": "MULTI_PHOTO"
                  }
                ],
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "loose"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "outputKey": "VIDEO",
              "renameOutput": true,
              "conditions": {
                "combinator": "and",
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "mt-video",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.media_type }}",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals",
                      "singleValue": true
                    },
                    "rightValue": "VIDEO"
                  }
                ],
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "loose"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "fallbackOutput": "extra"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fb-publish-text",
      "name": "Publish Feed Post",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        420,
        -280
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ 'https://graph.facebook.com/v23.0/' + $('Parse Request').first().json.page_id + '/feed' }}",
        "authentication": "none",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "access_token",
              "value": "={{ $('Parse Request').first().json.access_token }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "message",
              "value": "={{ $('Parse Request').first().json.content }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fb-publish-photo",
      "name": "Publish Photo Post",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        420,
        -80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ 'https://graph.facebook.com/v23.0/' + $('Parse Request').first().json.page_id + '/photos' }}",
        "authentication": "none",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "access_token",
              "value": "={{ $('Parse Request').first().json.access_token }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "url",
              "value": "={{ $('Parse Request').first().json.media_urls[0] }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "caption",
              "value": "={{ $('Parse Request').first().json.content }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "published",
              "value": "true"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fb-split-urls",
      "name": "Split Media URLs",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        420,
        120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "media_urls",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fb-upload-unpublished",
      "name": "Upload Unpublished Photo",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        660,
        120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ 'https://graph.facebook.com/v23.0/' + $('Parse Request').first().json.page_id + '/photos' }}",
        "authentication": "none",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "access_token",
              "value": "={{ $('Parse Request').first().json.access_token }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "url",
              "value": "={{ $json.media_urls }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "published",
              "value": "false"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fb-aggregate-photo-ids",
      "name": "Aggregate Photo IDs",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.aggregate",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        900,
        120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "aggregate": "aggregateIndividualFields",
        "fieldsToAggregate": {
          "fieldToAggregate": [
            {
              "fieldToAggregate": "id",
              "renameField": false
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fb-publish-multiphoto",
      "name": "Publish Multi-Photo Feed Post",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1140,
        120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ 'https://graph.facebook.com/v23.0/' + $('Parse Request').first().json.page_id + '/feed' }}",
        "authentication": "none",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
